caption:
Blueface is what happens when a teenager walks into a studio to return a phone charger and the studio decides it isn't letting him leave. Born Johnathan Porter in 1997, raised in Los Angeles, he was a high school quarterback with a college scholarship lined up before music ever entered the picture. He stepped into a booth almost by accident.

